    "Condition : 1 - On 14 August 2025, the subdivision of the existing building's extended first, second and third floor flat (Class C3) into a self-contained first floor one bedroom flat (Class C3) and self-contained second and third floor two bedroom flat (Class C3) was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\n\nThe applicant has submitted sufficient evidence to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the existing building's first floor one bedroom flat (Class C3) and second and third floor two bedroom flat (Class C3) had been in continuous use as self-contained dwellings (Class C3) since at least 14 August 2021 (four years prior to the validation date of this Certificate of Lawfulness Application)."
